{
  "description": "Labelled cases for the research contract schemas. Both validators -- include/marketscan/research/json_schema.hpp and research/contracts.py -- must give every case its expected verdict. A case is either an inline `document`, or a `base` file with a JSON Patch (add / replace / remove only) applied to it. Each case names the rule it exercises, so a case that stops failing for the right reason is visible.",
